                    "linkColor": "#514293",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "1. Pat the beans dry. Fry in the oil over a high heat, without stirring, until the bottoms crisp.<br><br>2. Add the garlic and chilli for a minute, then the greens and a splash of water.<br><br>3. When the greens wilt, take it off the heat. Zest and squeeze in the lemon. Salt to taste.",
